SUMMARY:Beaded plant Suncatcher
DESCRIPTION:Sunlight has a way of bringing a space to life. As it passes through a window\, it fills a room with color\, movement\, and small moments that make a house feel like home. In this workshop\, participants create beaded plant sun catchers inspired by the light that streams through our windows and the natural elements we welcome into our homes. By combining colorful beads and delicate forms\, each piece is designed to catch and reflect sunlight\, creating shifting patterns of color and light. The result is a decorative artwork that celebrates the warmth of home through nature\, color\, and light.
LOCATION:Ithra - Ithra Tower - Level 9\, Room 2
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-beaded-plant-suncatcher.html
